Map guest RAM before the VFIO device fd is opened.

NVIDIA's vGPU manager snapshots guest RAM at VFIO_GROUP_GET_DEVICE_FD.
Mapping afterwards leaves guest_max_gpfn at 0 and the guest driver cannot
read the slice.

